<title>Israel, Gaza and the West Bank: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/gaza/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-gaza-2026-11-26T12:56:39.717Z</guid>
<pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:56:39 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israeli strikes in Gaza have killed a Hamas political official, his wife and children, a senior education official and seven others, and separately eliminated a Hamas-appointed minister. Israel has threatened to displace one million Palestinians in Gaza unless Hamas disarms, and a report says Israel officially sanctions torture of Palestinian prisoners to extract confessions. Shin Bet has freed an Arab Israeli who was held for alleged election tampering. The conflict produced 21,440 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cqvg2n4mzl1jo?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss&quot;&gt;BBC News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/nov/26/israel-officially-sanctions-torture-palestinian-prisoners-confessions-report&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168862&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixwFBVV95cUxNNzFiM29KUVhvZHZUYTV1SWtlLXNYbXg3ZzRodFVmanZkNzJsczZ4UldfRkNkSW1fVDhMaTFYOW9ETUxXaXFKcktCTThoYnBYS21mVjQxYkNWM19MR1h0WHNSdjlGenRTNkExU2RKU0ZKNUhCRWR0OVU2VmFqTUJHeE5QMVNybDE4Qk1WTmp5VGgyWDV0NjhaM3h4Ulp1bWZDUThnSlI0TFMwMnQzNk5KQnZXVTRCUUxvc2FLbmlDYVREeHpwOUpV?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261126-israel-threatens-to-displace-one-million-palestinians-in-gaza-unless-hamas-disarms&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQUUFfcUhOc0dCeENHdXg3OW44TjRqZ3lma0NiVzNRMjZWYjZhc1duOG9pLXQ5U0FSdjM0RDB5VlFxTlhkWWFVUDFlMElTdk5FZkM4NS1GR2hCZ2lOdHltTVJNVG51MWlxZUZQV2pRcX